<title>POLAND: Stable investors, JP Morgan to get Handlowy shares.</title>
<headline>Stable investors, JP Morgan to get Handlowy shares.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish government said on Tuesday it had offered a group of stable investors including U.S. investment bank J.P. Morgan and Co Inc between 24 and 30 percent of Bank Handlowy's shares.</p>
</text>
